# StateCat is developed on Linux and Windows; force LF line endings
# on checkout so every text file is identical on every platform.
# Tests do line-based surgery on the fixture files, and a Windows
# checkout with CRLF would silently break replacements anchored
# on "\n" (that is how test_missing_heading_is_structural failed
# on the first Windows CI run).
* text=auto eol=lf
